# Canonical published URLs for AIOps App Model.
# Single source for GHA front bake, Vault push warnings, and ops cutovers.
# Public hosts only — never put secrets here.
#
# Consumers:
#   - .github/workflows/prod-k8s-deployment-front.yml (Vite bake)
#   - src/lib/api-base-url.ts (browser picks API from front hostname)
#   - scripts/vault/push_secrets.py (production URL hints)
#   - docs / CORS examples (reference these values)
#
# Front → API (same image, origin-based):
#   CORP_FRONT_URL  → CORP_API_URL   (kong-corp front → kong-external API)
#   CROSS_FRONT_URL → CROSS_API_URL  (cluster front → cluster API)
# Auth UI is /login on the front; API paths are /api/v1/auth/* on the API host.
#
# Gateway (DataForge): front corp (JumpCloud); API external + Netskope.
# Do not put the API on kong-corp (Cognito 302 breaks CORS OPTIONS).

CORP_FRONT_URL=https://aiops-app-model.loft-corp.com.br
CORP_API_URL=https://aiops-app-model-api.loft-corp.com.br

CROSS_FRONT_URL=https://aiops-app-model-front.cross.loft-prod.io
CROSS_API_URL=https://aiops-app-model-api.cross.loft-prod.io

# SSR / unknown-host fallback baked as VITE_API_URL (prefer corp public API).
FRONT_BAKE_API_URL=https://aiops-app-model-api.loft-corp.com.br
